/-!
# A085100

Rearrangement of natural numbers such that the sum of n terms beginning with the n-th term is a palindrome. Smallest number not included earlier is given priority.

The 71 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `0`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

